.TH AVR\-ORG\-INSTALL\-LIST 1 "" "avr 0.5.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-org-install-list \- List accessible installations across all your organizations.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr org install list
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List accessible installations across all your organizations.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
JSON FIELDS
    created_at, installation_id, organization_name, organization_slug,
    platform, platform_installation_id, platform_settings_url, state,
    target_id, target_name, target_type, configured_runner_count, degraded_runner_count
.fi
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-org-install (1),
.BR avr-org-install-add (1),
.BR avr-org-install-remove (1),
.BR avr-org-install-rotate (1),
.BR avr-org-install-runner (1),
.BR avr-org-install-set-selection (1)
